1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
You did NOT get replaced by AI.
You got replaced by a CHECKLIST.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
How AI AUTOMATION actually works.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:14,000
AUTOMATION just means steps a machine
follows without asking you first.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:21,000
For fifty years those steps
were RULES. If this, then that.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,000
RULES BREAK the moment real life looks
slightly different from the example.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Now add a MODEL. Something that reads a
messy pile and guesses the sensible thing.

7
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Set a GOAL. Give it tools.
CHECK the result. Go again.

8
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:53,000
That LOOP is the AUTOMATION. The
model is only one part of it.

9
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:01,000
It is NOT one genius robot. It is a
loop with a safety check bolted on.

10
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:08,000
And the CHECK is where it fails. No
CHECK means no automation, just VIBES.

11
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:13,000
GOAL. TOOLS. Check. Repeat.

12
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,000
So next time someone says the AI
does it, ask where the CHECK is.
